senses.gloss:
जागर, अस्, आ, m. f. waking, wakefulness, vigilance;
(अस्, आ, अम्), waking, awake; (अस्), m. a vision in a
waking state; = जगर, mail, armour.

जागुड जागुड, आस्, m. pl., N. of a people;
(अस्), m., N. of their country, renowned for its
saffron; (अम्), n. saffron.

जागरण, अस्, आ, अम्, waking, remaining awake;
(अम्), n. waking, watchfulness; keeping watch, sit-
ting up at night as part of a religious ceremony.

जागृवि, इस्, इस्, इ, Ved. watchful, attentive; awake;
not extinguished, clear, bright (as fire); active, ani-
mating, exciting; (इस्), m. fire or its deity; a king.
